/-!
# A174204

Scan the sequence of natural numbers, written in base 2, from left to right, delete each 2nd, 4th, 6th etc occurrence of digit 0 and each 2nd, 4th, 6th etc occurrence of digit 1. The sequence are the base-10 residuals.

The 32 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `0`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

